- Read root `AGENTS.md`.
- Read `docs/CONTEXT.md` and `docs/HANDOFF.md` before meaningful work.
- Inspect relevant code and tests rather than relying on old summaries.
- Follow the documentation-update workflow in `AGENTS.md`.
